      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's understandable to feel disappointed when you find out you're not as special or gifted as you once thought, but it's important to remember that everyone has their own unique talents and strengths. Your dedication to math and your ability to persevere through challenges are commendable. Instead of dwelling on what you feel you lack, you might want to explore new interests, set new goals, and appreciate the qualities that make you uniquely you. Remember, self-worth is not defined by comparing yourself to others, but rather by your own growth and individual achievements.",
